OL,3,ADavid Walliams accused of preying on
OL,4,Agirls as young as 15 after losing court
OL,5,Abattle to stop publication
OL,6,
OL,7,FWalliams denies all allegations,
OL,8,Fsaying: "I am not a sexual predator."
OL,9,FBut he acknowledges "at times I behaved
OL,10,Fthoughtlessly towards other people"
OL,12,FThe BBC says it's removing some content
OL,13,Ffrom its platforms - including his TV
OL,14,Fshow Little Britain
OL,16,FWalliams had asked the High Court to
OL,17,Fblock the publication of the
OL,18,Finvestigation, and said if the
OL,19,Fallegations were made public it was
OL,20,F"highly likely" he would kill himself.
OL,21,FThe court refused the request, saying
OL,22,Fthe risks could be mitigated
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
