OL,3,ASenior US soldier arrested by UK
OL,4,Acounter-terror police
OL,5,
OL,6,FSection one of the Act relates to
OL,7,Fobtaining or disclosing protected
OL,8,Finformation, while section three
OL,9,Frelates to assisting a foreign
OL,10,Fintelligence service.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
